#: keith_key/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "SKELETON KEY"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/3
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Hang on! My Content Aware is going off!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/11
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Keith, the skeleton key, has a bit of a... personality quirk that I would like you to warn you about."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/19
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "But... I also don't want to ruin the surprise."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/27
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "So I'll ask you - would you like to have the dramatic effect, or would you rather know from the start?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me! I don't want to be surprised."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay - I'll be on for the ride! Let's continue!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Okay. Basically he's a master manipulator. If you don't like that kind of behavior, you won't be too comfortable with this guy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You got it!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You cool with that? Or you want to skip it?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's skip it please!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm okay with that type of stuff."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "No worries - hey, Keith!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Please go ahead and open the attic door."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/29 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/47
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "We fit together rather well."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/37/0/s/0 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seems like there's some history here..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/7 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/18 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "We may have given love a shot."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/26
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But it did not really work out."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/34 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/31 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I prefer to cherish the fact that it led to our friendship."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/42 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/39 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/39
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Quite so!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/50 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/47
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "A superior level of relationship, in our humble opinions!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/58
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Carry on, then!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "How would you like your relationship with Keith to resolve?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friendship!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hate!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-4/7 keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-5/7 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/47/c-0/7 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/55/c-0/7 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Why, I would love that!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-4/18 keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-5/18 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/47/c-0/18 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/55/c-0/18 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/39/c-0/18
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I rather think we would do well together, you and I."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-4/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's love for you and Keith! This charmer has unlocked the way to your heart."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-4/34
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's love!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-4/71 keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-5/68 keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-6/49
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "See you out there on the next one!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-5/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and this old skeleton key have found your way towards a lasting friendship. Relationship unlocked!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-5/34
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Aww... friends forever."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Alas, it was never meant to be for you and the charming Keith. He will have to remain locked tight."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Enjoy your... hateship."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/skylar_keith_content/0/g-1/c-6/75 keith_key/keith_hate_joiner/35
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I never trusted that guy. I think he's been going around spreading way too much love for his own good."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not sure what you expected to find in the crawlspace, but it certainly wasn't this well-dressed, regal figure."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He seems quite stunned by your arrival, but the moment you liberate him from his underground prison, he comes alive with joy and gratitude."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/19
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "AH!! Fresh air, it has been far too long!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/33
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're welcome!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean... is it that big a deal?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I have been trapped within that accursed crawlspace for so long that... Well, I don’t even know how long it was!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Time lost all meaning under there."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But nevermind that now!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I am Keith. And I owe you a real debt of gratitude!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-0/44/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Please tell me, is there anything you’re wishing for that I can help you with?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-0/44/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m actually looking for a way to get into the attic. Do you know where I’d find it?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-0/44/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ha ha! Do I have some good news for you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I am in fact, a skeleton key! I can unlock just about anything with a keyhole in this house."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And a few things without keyholes, besides..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh! You were the thing Phoenicia told me I was supposed to be looking for!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds very useful to have!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well look no further, you found me!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-3/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But who is this Phoenicia? A friend? Or perhaps a special someone?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-3/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A friend"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-3/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A colleague"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-3/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My crush..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-3/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah, I absolutely adore friendship."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-3/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah from work? Heheh. There is no more fertile ground for relations."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-3/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Eh? This implies you are not lovers, but you wish to be, no?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-3/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "There is always a way."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I am nothing if not full of surprising talents."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "So! Dorian is giving you some trouble, hm? Nice to hear that some things haven’t changed while I was gone."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well fear not! Dorian and I go way back."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "We were practically made for each other, he and I."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "If you’ll allow me the briefest intrusion into your pocket, I’ll gladly accompany you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_discovery/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Without further ado, Keith leaps straight into your pocket!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian looms over you, arms crossed over his broad chest. He seems almost smug about blocking your way today."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/33
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "'Ello mate. Let me give you a tip..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/41
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "When you see me with my arms crossed like this?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/49
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "It means you're not gettin' through."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/66
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "What might it take to uncross them, I wonder...?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/74
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Keith!? Is it really you!?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/85
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Hello old friend. It is me, alright."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/93
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Where on Earth have you been?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/101
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I've been tucked away with my thoughts, you might say."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/109
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I never knew why you left."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/117
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I'm so sorry I never said goodbye. I never had the chance."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/125
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well, I... I've missed you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/133
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I've missed you, too, dearest Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/141
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And I am back to stay!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/149
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Now come here, and give me a hug, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/157
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I could never resist you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/165
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian and Keith curl their arms around each other, fitting together as perfectly as... well, a key and a lock."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/190
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And just like that, the door is open."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/198/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You two seem like lovers."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/199/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was brilliant!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah, we've tried that..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It did not really work out."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/47/0/s/0 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/55/0/s/0 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I agree. Maybe we can be friends, Keith?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/47/1/s/0 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/55/1/s/0 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't you think love can include friendship?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/47/c-1/7 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/55/c-1/7 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Maybe so... But it can also complicate it mightily."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/47/c-1/15 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/55/c-1/15 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Call me closed off, but love tends to get messy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-0/47/c-1/23 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/55/c-1/23 keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "For us, friendship is the way to go."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "He gets me every time."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Just a little game we play."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I can't keep him from anything he wants."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "He's my greatest weakness."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And without you, I would have nothing to do!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So no matter what, Keith can always get you to open up?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But it didn't really work out."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "That's right!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "No matter how much I feel like staying closed..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I can always get him to reveal what's going on inside."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/c-1/55/c-1/31
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "That's really the strength of friendship."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/g-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's see what's in store in the attic!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/g-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well Keith, crack him on open!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/g-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope some day I can open you up like that, Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/g-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "In ya go, mate!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/g-0/15/c-3/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "It's already done."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/dorian_attic_door_and_keith/0/g-0/15/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Maybe you can..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Hello, dear Owner. It's nice to see you again!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh,"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/14/s/5
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "is fine, Keith. You don't need to call me 'Owner.'"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh. I like the sound of that!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/c-0/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah! But of course. Forgive me for my old-fashioned habits."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I thought you might! People do seem to enjoy titles, however informal."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Anyhow, I'm glad you dropped by."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I've just been here, relaxing on Abel's broad back!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I've convinced him to accept my presence."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/30
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Convinced me? Keith, you're more than welcome!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I'm lucky to have someone as wise and knowledgeable about the home history around."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/46
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You're too kind, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/57
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "He's wonderful, isn't he?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/65
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I confess, it's been marvelous just to be out from under that rug."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/73
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Now that I'm here, I'd love for us to get to know one another."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/81
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "For my part, I am, as they say, 'an open book.'"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_first_encounter/0/g-0/92
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Is there anything I can tell you about myself?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Anything else you'd like to know about me?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So how long were you under there, really?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How old are you?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's about it, for now. Anything you'd like to ask me?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I have asked myself the same question, time and time again..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Those were dark times, and I had plenty of opportunities to wonder at it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "However, I've come to the conclusion that some questions may never be answered."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you do something wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did the previous owner lose you?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "What? What would give you that idea! I certainly hope not!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I've always tried to behave in a manner that others find suitable."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Although I suppose it's always possible that I made some mistake I'm unaware of..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But that was so long ago, I-I doubt anyone would remember."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I suppose that's possible, but I doubt it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It would appear I was placed there intentionally."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I myself have no recollection of the initial incident."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/g-0/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's strange."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/g-0/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You might have been traumatized."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/g-0/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Indeed... But it was so long ago."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/g-0/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You're probably right."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/g-0/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But no matter. I'm here now!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Were you exploring on your own?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I could have been. I do like to do a bit of poking around, looking into things."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Opening closed doors, as it were."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-0/31/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I suppose I might have gotten myself lost."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "How old do you think I am?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... 20? Yep. 20."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Er... 50-something?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hrm...75 ...ish?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're 119."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-0/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah hah! That's right! Not so old as I look, am I?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-0/22/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh. But I thought you were all wise and stuff?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-0/22/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look exactly your age, which is rather good if you ask me..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-0/22/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Eh, 20 is old for a key like myself! I know this house better than anyone."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-0/22/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well, look who's talking, you charmer!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Do my gray hairs reveal so much? Well, so it is!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0 keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've been here a while, then?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/1/s/0 keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They make you a real silver fox, to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7 keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You've got that right. Longer than even Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/7 keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Careful or you'll make me blush beneath this beard."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Not exactly spry as I once was! But I've still got plenty of life left in me."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Precisely! I've seen a lot! But I feel as young as I ever did!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How on Earth did I nail that?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't look a day over thirty."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Yes, I'll admit I was rather surprised. You must be quite lucky."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-3/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Or perhaps you were clever enough to gather some inside information before this conversation..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-3/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "That would be impressive,eh? I wonder what else you were told?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-3/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And I'm plenty... functional. If you know what I mean."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_getting_toknowme/0/c-1/15/c-3/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Keys do not age as most objects do."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Why, yes!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Hopefully, I'll get to know a lot about you in the future!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But for starters, how about a few basics?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Like... Do you prefer blondes, brunettes, or... something else?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Blondes are my style."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's the dark hair for me!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm a sucker for a silver fox, actually."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't have a preference!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "From flaxen to gold, such beauty to behold!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Mysterious, brooding... the antihero!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Oh... Um... Ahem."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keith blushes, breaking your gaze to contemplate something off to the side."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well then."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah, open-minded! I like that!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Alright, how about another question."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Do you believe in destiny?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do. Our fates are sealed."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No! The future is open for me to decide."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I see. So, we were destined to meet."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Wonderful. Open is how we like things around here!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "What else do I want to know?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah! Do you think of yourself as traditional, or open-minded?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Traditional. I like structure."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Open minded."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A mix of both, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Mmmm... You appreciate boundaries. I see that."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "That's how you stay young, you know."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I guess all of us have some traditions we like to keep to."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And staying open-minded in our lives can bring new experiences!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "How about just one more question for now."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Forgive me for the boldness, but where do you keep your cash?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "In the safe."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like I'm going to tell you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "A wise choice. But I must warn you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/19
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "That question was a bit of a test, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/27
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "As you know, I am master of opening things, but also of locking them up."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/35
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And I would highly advise you to be more circumspect in answering questions of that sort!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh. Oops."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah but I trust you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Hahaha! That's alright! I only do this to help keep your eyes open!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/c-0/15 keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "There are always some who might seek to pursue their own agendas!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/c-0/23 keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/c-1/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Maybe even in your own home..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/c-0/31 keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/c-1/31
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It's good to have an open heart, but also good to be mindful."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-9/43/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Of course! But you can't trust <i>everyone</i>."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah! Brilliant!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Now, as you know, I am a master of opening things up."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But I am equally a master of locking things shut!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/31
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And you've just passed a test of mine to ensure you're keeping your secrets safe."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/39
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well done."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/50
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And for the record, you ought to keep it in the safe, eh? Just in case!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good call. I'll move it there now."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/58/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Duh! I never kept it in... like... my sock drawer or anything."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/58/c-0/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Better (in the) safe than sorry!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/58/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah. A common place for stashers to stash things!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-2/c-10/58/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Unfortunately, also a common place searched by crooks."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Now, I must say that with age comes a need to manage energy more efficiently."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And I'm feeling a bit tired. I'll need to rest."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you said you were only 20!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-3/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm still young and I feel exhausted."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Did I say that? How forgetful of me!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-3/c-11/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I meant fifty. Ish."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-3/c-11/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Or... Thereabouts."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I suppose we could all use a break!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Anyhow, I hope you'll come and see me soon."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "There's much that I can tell you..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "<i>Yawn... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/Keith_gettingtoknowyou/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Things that will prove quite valuable to you, I think."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You find Keith lying peacefully on the table, a subtle smile playing on his face. He looks up happily as you approach, and waves you over."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Hello, my friend. What a pleasure it is to see your face again."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You know, after so long down there in that accursed crawlspace, I have come to truly appreciate the little things."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/30
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Such as the feeling of sunshine as I lie here."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/38
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Or the calm murmur of the other things in the house as they go about their business."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keith's head slumps forward, his eyes fluttering shut. He snores quietly, both hands clutched around the key-like cane that steadies him."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/62
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Zzzz..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Keith?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um... <i>poke.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Keith wakes with a start."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Huh? Uh qué, qué? What? Oh! Haha Hello. Sorry. I just dozed off..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It's just so nice here on the table!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ahhh, the joy of being free!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "If I just open myself up to such simple happiness, it seems to flood in..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/46
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ah, if only I had known such wisdom in my younger life!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/54
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It might have saved me from much suffering."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you been through a lot?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem very wise, Keith."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Alas, but I have. Such trials and tribulations as I wouldn't bore you with."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Perhaps. Wisdom may just be the result of having made too many mistakes."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You see, one does not reach my advanced age without having messed up once or twice along the way."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Although I pride myself on opening things, there are some doors that are meant to remain closed."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you referring to you and Dorian?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is this about how you ended up in the crawlspace?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Oh... I don't know. Perhaps."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But, well, I don't think that was ever destined to work out."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Is it? I... I don't think so. I still don't recall any specifics."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Never mind all that. That is in the past."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And we must be here, in the present, if we are to find happiness, eh!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "In any case, what I'm trying to get at is that what's most important in life is..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Learning to appreciate the little things?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Staying in the here-and-now."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pleasure, baby. I'm a hedonist."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Vengeance on our enemies. Justice."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Like companionship. I must say, I'm glad we've met."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Just so! Let's enjoy this peaceful moment together for a bit."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/7/b/1
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You're more interesting than first meets the eye, Owner."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/8/b/1
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You're more interesting than first meets the eye."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "My, my! You've got some fangs in your mouth, haven't you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You know, you seem like a lovely sort."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And in fact, there's something I'd like to give you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But before I do, I need to make sure you're on the right track developing your character!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_second_encounter/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "So..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_check/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Let me take a closer look at you..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_check/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He narrows his eyes, evaluating you with a sharp, up-and-down gaze. You can feel yourself sweat just a little under his intense scrutiny."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_check/24/b/1
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Hm. You could do with some more personality. Keep going around the house and getting to make new friends."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_check/24/b/9
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Maybe I'll have something for you next time!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/all_candies_given/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well... look at that."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/all_candies_given/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I'm fresh out of candies to give you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/all_candies_given/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Damn shame."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I see you're making progress."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Here's something that all good humans will enjoy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He holds his hand out to you, depositing something small in your palm. It smells sweet."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/49
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It's a little candy, my favorite."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/57
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Take this Poise Candy. It'll show them that you mean business!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/65
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "This can be used in certain situations where you've burned your bridges, and wish to make amends."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/73
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take in the scent of the Poise Candy—something about it makes you feel steadier somehow, like you could stand up to anyone."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/81
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Consume it wisely!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/89
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Eat it if you'd like to put your foot down and make someone reconsider!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/97
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And please, do refrain from taking advantage, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_candy_explain/108
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "A sweet tooth is a powerful tool."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_smarts_candy/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Here's a Smarts Candy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_smarts_candy/25
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It'll turn you into a real intellectual dazzler."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_smarts_candy/33
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take in the scent of the Smarts Candy—even a small whiff of it makes you feel smarter already."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_smarts_candy/41
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Use it wisely, eh? To wow anyone with your brainpower!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_empathy_candy/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "This Empathy Candy is just for you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_empathy_candy/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take in the scent of the Empathy Candy—for half a second, you feel as though you want to give the entire world a hug."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_empathy_candy/33
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It'll help you convince someone that in the end, you really do understand their struggles."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_charm_candy/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Not that you need it, but this Charm Candy might come in handy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_charm_candy/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take in the scent of the Charm Candy—is it your imagination, or did you just get 5% more charismatic?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_charm_candy/33
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "This tasty morsel will turn your natural charm up to eleven!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_sass_candy/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Here's a Sass Candy! My favorite!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_sass_candy/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take in the scent of the Sass Candy—already your brain is coming up with all sorts of jokes. Perhaps you should consider a career in stand-up comedy?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_sass_candy/33
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It is sure to make you the delight of the day with your wit and zingers."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well, if it isn't my dear friend!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "How go your various quests?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Things are good!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Could be better."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well, that's great to hear!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And I hope you've been putting that lovely personality to your advantage!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Keep at it!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And don't forget to use that lovely personality to your advantage!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I... think I have?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I am, of course, talking about your SPECS points!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It's critically important that you master these, if you want to be successful around the house."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You've got to up your numbers by talking to as many objects as you can."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can personality really be measured like that? With points?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm crushing it on character!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't you see what a charmer I already am?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm certainly working on it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ahh, you know it, you saucy dog. [sass 55]"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I can feel that deeply. [empathy 55]"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "To an enlightened mind, that's abundantly clear. [smarts 55]"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I see it in your beautiful eyes. [charm 55]"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait. Did you just pass a speech check?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-2/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hang on a sec... You just used SPECS on me!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Of course. I always do."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Nooo, not on YOU! Heavens, no!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Those ol' SPECS you see are just a reflection of my personal characteristics."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You do not think I'd sing the praises of an art I hadn't mastered myself, do you?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "In all my decades, I've mastered a lot of things."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "The arts of charm, of wit, of confidence, etc."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Now I want to share what I know with you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I just want you to understand how valuable and useful your SPECS attributes can be."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "They'll open up all sorts of exciting possibilities around the house."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/48
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And you never know when one of them will prove to be invaluable!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/59/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They certainly have been useful so far!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/59/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for helping me out, Keith."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/59/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your personality must really shine!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/59/c-10/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "See? I knew you'd find them helpful! We could all do with a little more personality pizazz!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/59/c-11/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well, I just want you to succeed. Happy to offer what little guidance I can!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-3/59/c-12/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Oh, I dunno. These days it feels a bit rusty, if I'm honest!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_third_encounter/0/g-5/3
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Now then, before I let you go, how's your progress been?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Well, if it isn't the SPECSiest person I've ever met!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was a terrible pun, Keith. But I'm here for it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Failed your Sass check, I see..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ahh, I thought it was rather clever."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Perhaps I'm a bit behind the times..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Oh, you try being clever all the time, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Anyhow, to what do I owe the pleasure?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually Keith, I'd love to see if I can get a bit of candy!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's chat!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Oh, sure! I'll take a look at you when we're done chatting."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Brilliant! What about?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just wanted to say hi! And flirt with you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wanted to see if you needed anything."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "My, my... Isn't that flattering."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Let's see if you're flirty enough to catch my eye..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Oh that's so kind of you. Things are generally very good."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I can't think of anything I really need..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Only... Well... No, I shouldn't even bring it up."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/31/0/s/0 keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know me well enough to know I wouldn't judge you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You're right... I sense the truth in that."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I'm flirty alright. Check out this wink!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's see if you're worth my effort, silver fox."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My raw confidence is more than enough, I think you'll find. <i>Just stand there.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look at this sexy dance. <i>Gyrate strangely.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "With a dazzling eye like yours, that wink is just icing on the cake."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ooo, I love a bit of banter!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Lure me in, make me want to open you up..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "How mysterious!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Like a locked door I can't wait to open..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/c-3/11 keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Oh that's... well... Hmm."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "This was fun. But with experience comes the desire to take one's time."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "To savor the game, as it were. I haven't tasted romance in so long..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And the flavor is so sweet."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Let's flirt a bit more some time, if you feel like it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Until then, there's something I've been thinking about asking you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anything, Keith."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It's like this, you see..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I can't stop thinking about why I ended up in that crawlspace."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ever since you first asked me about it, I began to question it more myself."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/27
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Did I do something wrong? Make some mistake?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/35
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "My heart has always been in the right place, but perhaps I slipped up in the past."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/43
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Oh no... was it some act of betrayal? Or rejection?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/51
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I just can't seem to put it all behind me."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How can I help you get to the bottom of it?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe it's best to just leave the past in the past."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "There's one way I can think of, but it might not be so easy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/c-1/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You're probably right. Ok. I'll just try not to think about it for a bit."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart/0/c-1/19
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Now, before you go... Let's see if you're ready for some more candy!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I almost don't even want to ask you this, for fear of what you'll think."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But here it is."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "As you may or may not know, I believe one of the previous owners of the house is..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "...'affiliated' shall we say? With your current employer."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The Valdivian folks used to live here?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They say there's no such thing as coincidence but dang."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I'm not sure what I think about destiny, but this seems... fortuitous."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Yes. I believe so. I heard about this from Mac."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Yes. Strange, isn't it? Perhaps it's destiny."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "In any case, as I was wracking my brain to come up with a memory of my imprisonment, I thought of something."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It is perhaps a... just a fleeting idea."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But I recalled that one of the Valdivian folks used to keep an online journal."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "He was, in particular, a real stickler for recording dates, accounts, etc..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But most specifically the locations of important things!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you think he might have put in there what happened to you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This could be the key to your mystery, Keith."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds like an invasion of privacy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I don't know for sure, of course... But it is possible."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "That's exactly what I've been thinking."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I know! That's why I hesitated to tell you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But if it meant finding out what happened to me... It might be worth it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "So... What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passwordtomyheart2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Truly, I'm utterly open to questions or.. or thoughts."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't you think there might be personal stuff in there?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How would you even get into the online account?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if we got caught?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ethically this sounds a bit weird."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think that's all I have to ask about this for now."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-0/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "That's a risk. But he wasn't a very 'personal' kind of guy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-0/19
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "He wasn't open, you see. Very mechanical in his dealings."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-0/27
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Dare I say it... He was borderline sociopathic."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-1/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I've thought about this. Now, I am not certain, but I have a feeling Mac could do it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-1/19
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "They are so gifted!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-1/27
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "They could probably... eh, what are the youth calling it these days... Erm, em em hack, \"hack\" it?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-1/35
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Then I could poke around and see if there's anything in there that references me."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-1/43
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "If not, we just leave it alone and nobody's the wiser."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-2/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "We could ask Mac about that. But I don't think it's a big danger."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-2/19
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I'm not saying there's no risk... But I think Mac is clever enough to pull it off."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-3/11
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I agree. That's why I hesitated before telling you I'd even thought about it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-3/19
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It's in my nature to be curious, to want to open things up."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-3/27
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "So the idea appears harmless to me."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_questionme/0/c-3/35
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I leave the decision up to you, at the end of the day."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_redirector/0/4
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Hi there..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_redirector/0/12
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I have to tell you, I cannot stop thinking about the idea of figuring out my past."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_redirector/0/20
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I do not think I can focus on anything until you're willing to hear me out about it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_redirector/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess we'll just end our relationship here, then."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_redirector/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then let's talk about it."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_redirector/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I... I guess so."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "So what do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Am I mad for thinking up this strange scheme?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Should I just leave the past where it lies, never to be recalled?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Or shall we take the plunge together, and seek the truth in strange places?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/32
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I will gladly abide by your decision, whatever it is."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it. Let's hack that password!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not comfortable with this. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I'm overjoyed! This will be the beginning of a great adventure."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Next time I see you, we can begin."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/c-0/32
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I need to prepare myself to learn the truth."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I understand... Hmm."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Actually, I really don't. I thought you were my friend."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I trusted you to help me get to the bottom of this."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But I guess at the end of the day you're really just in this for what I can give you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "So. Come on back if you want candy, but do not mistake this for a friendship.."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_passworddecision/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Now, before you go, let's see if you're ready for some candy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fifth_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Hello! I'm so excited to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fifth_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I've been thinking non-stop about our plan."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fifth_encounter/0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Are you ready to make some moves? Or can I help you with something else?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fifth_encounter/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually I thought I'd flirt with you a bit first."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fifth_encounter/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready. Let's do this!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fifth_encounter/0/26/s/0 keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually... I Realized Mac! So they can't help us!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fifth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "We'll see if you're up to the task..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_fifth_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I think it's time we brought in our accomplice, Mac!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I won't be so easily won over this time, you'll find."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd go to any lengths to win over such an elegant, kind key!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And yet I find you've already won me."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh stop playing hard to get, you stud muffin."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hold my beer. <i>Gyrate even more strangely than last time.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hold my beer. <i>Gyrate strangely.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Your words have charmed open my heart."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Your openness, it would seem, is opening my heart."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I pretend to be locked when in fact my heart is quite open for you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You know, somehow I am still not intrigued by this motion."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Flirting with you is quite lovely."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "As you know, I do enjoy a bit of banter!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But what say you we return to the matter at hand?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Are you ready to bring Mac in on our cheeky little plan?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do this."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know what... I've changed my mind about that..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/c-6/13
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "What? After you led me on?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/c-6/21
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I really thought you cared about helping me understand my past."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/c-6/29
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "But you just wanted to pull the wool over a poor old key's eyes..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/c-6/40
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "It's all about the candy for you, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_flirt_check2/0/g-0/c-6/48
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I guess we should see if you've earned one then, and then I'd like you to leave."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/6
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Eh, eh, eh... But before we do... I think we ought to be prepared for them to say no."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/14
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "After all, this is an odd thing to ask."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/22
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "So... what should we do if they refuse?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We could try using SPECS points?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll strong-arm them."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We should just leave it alone if they don't want in."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's all in how we ask them, my friend..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Why, that's brilliant!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You're bolder than I thought! And I find that quite attractive."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "This is the answer to my past..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We have to respect their decision."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't worry. We'll get in! I'll make it happen."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You're the best. A true friend!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Genius! I'll leave everything up to you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/4
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Ok, here they come!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mac wheels into the room with a kind smile on their face, greeting the two of you with a small wave."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/29
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I believe my presence is requested?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/37
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "That's right, Mac! We have a rather curious request for you..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/45
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We need to hack into an online journal, Mac."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We've got to find the key to Keith's imprisonment."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I see. This is something I may be able to help you with."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Only... I must tell you that this goes against my intended functions."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Very well! I'll be happy to help."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Where is this key located within my storage?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/c-5/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's in an online journal, actually. Someone else's online journal."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/c-5/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, ya see, it's not EXACTLY located in YOUR storage. Per se."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Why didn't you say so? Of course I can help you with that!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Am I to understand that you are asking me to do some unauthorized breaking and entering?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That makes it sound so sketch! It's just some dude's online journal!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's exactly correct, Mac. Sounds fun, right?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Yes! There's probably almost nothing interesting in there!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-1/c-7/18
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Be that as it may..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "While this does sound entertaining..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I'm afraid I have to refuse. This goes against the ethical model coded into me at creation."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For a computer with such well-rounded programming capacity, you're kind of a square."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I completely understand, Mac. Keith, I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just see if we can't update that ethics model, shall we? 010001101..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mac, please? Keith is really suffering here."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "What?! No I'm not! I'm cool! Let's go do some bad guy stuff!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-9/18
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Nice one..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You... You'll let them lock you out just like that?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "And keep me from discovering the secret of my imprisonment?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry Keith, but I can't force them."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just try one more thing... <i>Tickle Mac's keyboard.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Fine. Then I'm afraid you cannot force me to continue being a friend to you."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I no longer feel as though I can let you in anymore."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "If you want candy, I'll still provide it. But if it's intimacy you seek?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-0/34
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Consider me locked."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You run your fingers across Mac's keyboard and the reaction is immediate—they jerk away from your touch, uncontrollable laughter bursting from them."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Teeeheeee!!! Oh, stop it! Stop it!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-1/26
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Fine! I'll help you!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Hmm. Well wouldn't you know?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-11/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "On further examination I appear to have a rather fuzzy definition of 'morally acceptable'"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-11/23
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "When it comes to online data piracy."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-11/31
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Sweet! Let's do some hacking!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-12/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well, if it means we could help him... I guess I can make an exception!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin/0/g-2/c-12/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Let's do it!"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Ok, let me just boot up TOR..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "If we're gonna do this, let's do it right."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Keith, can you point me at the URL?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/24
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Sure thing, Mac."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/32
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "<i>tappity tap tap tap</i>"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/40
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Ok, here we are..."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/48
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "A password login screen."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/56
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And yikes... Looks like it's protected against brute force attacks."
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So we can't just smash it open with a hammer?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Meaning we've got limited attempts?"
msgstr ""

#: keith_key/keith_bringmacin2/0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
